{"metrics":{"latencyMs":2221},"output":{"message":{"content":[{"reasoningContent":{"reasoningText":{"signature":"","text":"I need to calculate 17 * 23. Let me do this step by step.\n\nMethod 1: Breaking it down\n17 * 23 = 17 * (20 + 3)\n= 17 * 20 + 17 * 3\n= 340 + 51\n= 391\n\nLet me verify this another way:\n17 * 23 = (20 - 3) * 23\n= 20 * 23 - 3 * 23\n= 460 - 69\n= 391\n\nBoth methods give 391, so that's correct."}}},{"text":"# Calculating 17 × 23\n\n## Method: Break it into simpler parts\n\nI'll decompose 23 into 20 + 3:\n\n**17 × 23 = 17 × (20 + 3)**\n\n**Step 1:** Multiply 17 by 20\n- 17 × 20 = 340\n\n**Step 2:** Multiply 17 by 3\n- 17 × 3 = 51\n\n**Step 3:** Add the results\n- 340 + 51 = **391**\n\n## Verification:\nI can check this using a different decomposition (20 - 3) × 23:\n- 20 × 23 = 460\n- 3 × 23 = 69\n- 460 - 69 = 391 ✓\n\n**Answer: 17 × 23 = 391**"}],"role":"assistant"}},"stopReason":"end_turn","usage":{"cacheReadInputTokenCount":0,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"inputTokens":55,"outputTokens":361,"serverToolUsage":{},"totalTokens":416}}560 2502
