{"metrics":{"latencyMs":3187},"output":{"message":{"content":[{"reasoningContent":{"reasoningText":{"text":" We need to calculate 17 * 23. Let me think step by step.\n\nMethod 1: Direct multiplication\nWe can multiply 17 by 23 directly:\n17 × 23 = ?\n\nLet's break it down:\n17 × 20 = 340\n17 × 3 = 51\n340 + 51 = 391\n\nSo 17 × 23 = 391\n\nMethod 2: Using the distributive property\n17 × 23 = 17 × (20 + 3) = 17×20 + 17×3 = 340 + 51 = 391\n\nMethod 3: Using the formula (a+b)(a-b) = a² - b²\nWe can write 17 × 23 as (20-3) × (20+3) = 20² - 3² = 400 - 9 = 391\n\nLet me verify:\n17 × 23 = 391\nCheck: 391 ÷ 17 = 23? 17×20 = 340, 391-340 = 51, 51÷17 = 3, so 20+3 = 23. ✓\n\nThe answer is 391."}}},{"text":" **Step-by-step reasoning:**\n\n1. **Break down the multiplication:** I can use the distributive property to make this easier.\n   - 23 = 20 + 3\n   - So 17 × 23 = 17 × (20 + 3)\n\n2. **Multiply separately:**\n   - 17 × 20 = 340\n   - 17 × 3 = 51\n\n3. **Add the results:**\n   - 340 + 51 = 391\n\n**Verification using an alternative method:**\nI can also use the difference of squares formula: (a - b)(a + b) = a² - b²\n- 17 × 23 = (20 - 3) × (20 + 3) = 20² - 3² = 400 - 9 = 391\n\n**Answer: 17 × 23 = 391**"}],"role":"assistant"}},"stopReason":"end_turn","usage":{"inputTokens":25,"outputTokens":436,"serverToolUsage":{},"totalTokens":461}}434 1991
